#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Add a section line and choose one of your preconfigured section templates "
"from the database (e.g. <em>Brick Wall Partition, High-End Parquet Flooring, "
"or Commercial Cooking Hub</em>)."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມແຖວໝວດໝູ່ ແລະ ເລືອກຮ່າງໝວດໝູ່ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແລ້ວຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນ (ເຊັ່ນ: <em>ຝາກໍ່ດິນຈີ່, ພື້ນໄມ້ປາເກ້ຊັ້ນດີ, "
"ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ເຮືອນຄົວການຄ້າ</em>)."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add lines for missing employees, projects and tasks."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມລາຍການສຳລັບພະນັກງານ, ໂຄງການ ແລະ ໜ້າວຽກທີ່ຍັງຂາດ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
