msgstr "ການຄິດໄລ່ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຂັ້ນສູງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງຄິດໄລ່"

#. module: construction
#: model:planning.role,name:construction.planning_role_3
msgid "Aerial Work Platform"
msgstr "ກະເຊົ້າໄຟຟ້າຂາໄກຕັດ"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"All new projects get their dedicated document folder from the template "
"project folder. Adjust it according to your needs!"
msgstr ""
"ທຸກໂຄງການໃໝ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບໂຟນເດີເອກະສານສະເພາະຈາກໂຟນເດີໂຄງການຕົ້ນແບບ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມ"
"ຕ້ອງການ!"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"All the emails sent to help@your-company-domain will create a ticket that "
"can be assigned to ensure the follow-up."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກອີເມວທີ່ສົ່ງໄປຍັງ help@your-company-domain ຈະສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງບັນຫາ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດມອບໝາຍວຽກເພື່ອຕິດຕ"
"າມຕໍ່ໄດ້."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:construction.sale_order_template_1
msgid "All work guaranteed 10 years"
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນທຸກໜ້າວຽກ 10 ປີ"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively select the On All Order Lines method to directly input a "
"negative percentage of cost offset."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ ແມ່ນເລືອກວິທີ \"ໃນທຸກລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້\" ເພື່ອປ້ອນເປີເຊັນຄ່າລົບສຳລັບການຊົດເຊີຍຕົ້ນທຶນໂດຍກົ"
"ງ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively to preparing your project timeline with project tasks or "
"planning shifts, we provide a Gantt view of the manufacturing orders."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການກຽມກຳນົດເວລາໂຄງການດ້ວຍໜ້າວຽກ ຫຼື ການວາງແຜນຜຽນເຮັດວຽກແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາກໍຍັງມີມຸມມອງແຜ"
"ນວາດ Gantt ສຳລັບໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດໃຫ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, open the remarks, from the Reporting menu of the Project App, "
"to access them all (filter by project for more clarity)."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດຂໍ້ສັງເກດ ຈາກເມນູລາຍງານຂອງແອັບໂຄງການ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເບິ່ງທັງໝົດໄດ້ (ກັ່ນຕອງຕາມໂຄງການເ"
"ພື່ອຄວາມຊັດເຈນຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ)."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can select on specific product lines the Buy route to "
"directly generate a request for quotation for onsite delivery to your "
"supplier.<br/>This is very handy for products like concrete for instance. "
"Don't forget to define your vendors in the product form to leverage this."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ \"ຊື້\" ໃນບາງລາຍການສິນຄ້າສະເພາະ ເພື່ອສ້າງໃບຂໍລາຄາໃຫ້ຜູ້ສະໜອງສົ່ງຕົກຮອດ"
"ໜ້າວຽກໂດຍກົງ.<br/>ວິທີນີ້ສະດວກຫຼາຍສຳລັບສິນຄ້າເຊັ່ນ ຊີມັງ/ເບຕົງ. ຢ່າລືມກຳນົດຜູ້ສະໜອງໃນແບບຟອມສິນຄ້າເພື່"
"ອນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "Architect"
msgstr "ສະຖາປະນິກ"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As any business you have overhead costs but some may be specific to some "
"projects.\n"
"            You can add specific lines to bill your customers for those or "
"in some cases you may have to dilute those costs in your quotation, "
"typically answering call for tender."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບທຸກທຸລະກິດ ທ່ານຍ່ອມມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍບໍລິຫານທົ່ວໄປ ແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນສະເພາະບາງໂຄງການ.\n"
"            ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມລາຍການສະເພາະເພື່ອຮຽກເກັບເງິນຈາກລູກຄ້າ ຫຼື ໃນບາງກໍລະນີທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງຖົວ"
"ສະເລ່ຍຕົ້ນທຶນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນລົງໃນໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນການຍື່ນຊອງປະມູນ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As site manager, on the other hand, you might record time for your whole "
"team at the end of the week."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ໃນຖານະຜູ້ຄຸ້ມຄອງສະໜາມ ທ່ານອາດຈະບັນທຶກເວລາໃຫ້ທີມງານທັງໝົດໃນທ້າຍອາທິດ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As soon as it's updated, you can create a regular invoice to expense your "
"customer for the delivered work."
msgstr ""
"ທັນທີທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ທົ່ວໄປເພື່ອຮຽກເກັບເງິນຈາກລູກຄ້າຕາມວຽກທີ່ໄດ້ຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Assuming there will be manual labour behind every product from the quote, "
"start filling the time estimate for some of them. <br/>The total labour time "
"and even time for project management and purchases are computed "
"accordingly..."
msgstr ""
"ສົມມຸດວ່າມີແຮງງານຄົນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງທຸກສິນຄ້າໃນໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມປ້ອນເວລາປະເມີນສຳລັບບາງລາຍການ. "
"<br/>ເວລາແຮງງານລວມ ລວມທັງເວລາຄຸ້ມຄອງໂຄງການ ແລະ ການຈັດຊື້ ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ຕາມນັ້ນ..."

