#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM module</strong> helps construction companies capture leads "
"from multiple sources, track communications, and schedule follow-ups. <br/"
">You can prioritize high-value opportunities and turn inquiries into "
"profitable projects."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂມດູນ CRM</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ບໍລິສັດກໍ່ສ້າງເກັບກຳລູກຄ້າມຸ່ງຫວັງຈາກຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງ, ຕິດຕາມການສື່ສ"
"ານ ແລະ ກຳນົດເວລາຕິດຕາມວຽກ. <br/>ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງໂອກາດທີ່ມີມູນຄ່າສູງ ແລະ ປ່ຽນກ"
"ານສອບຖາມໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນໂຄງການທີ່ສ້າງກຳໄລ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Planning app</strong> schedules tasks, allocates employees, and "
"coordinates equipment use across multiple construction sites."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບການວາງແຜນ</strong> ຊ່ວຍຈັດຕາຕະລາງວຽກ, ຈັດສັນພະນັກງານ ແລະ ປະສານງານການນຳໃ"
"ຊ້ອຸປະກອນໃນຫຼາຍສະຖານທີ່ກໍ່ສ້າງ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Projects App</strong> allows you to manage tasks, assign "
"resources, and create milestones for each construction project."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບໂຄງການ</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄຸ້ມຄອງໜ້າວຽກ, ມອບໝາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນ ແລະ ສ້າງໄລຍະສຳຄັ"
"ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຄງການກໍ່ສ້າງ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Sales App</strong> enables rapid creation of professional "
"quotations. You can use quotation templates, apply discounts, and send "
"polished proposals directly to clients."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບການຂາຍ</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາແບບມືອາຊີບໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່າ"
"ງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ, ນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນຫຼຸດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ສົມບູນແບບໄປຫາລູກຄ້າໂດຍກົງ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "The construction industries come in two parts:"
msgstr "ທຸລະກິດກໍ່ສ້າງແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງພາກສ່ວນ:"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The default setting for billing is to invoice all recorded time sheets so "
"that your work can be invoiced directly. You can however easily introduce a "
"time sheet approval process for manager to confirm and correct recorded time:"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການຮຽກເກັບເງິນ ແມ່ນການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຕາມທຸກບັນທຶກເວລາ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຮຽກເກັບເງິນ"
"ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຂະບວນການອະນຸມັດບັນທຶກເວລາໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ຈັດການກວດສ"
"ອບ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂເວລາທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້:"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The end date is affected if recording delivery after the manufacturing order "
"planned end."
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີສິ້ນສຸດຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ຖ້າບັນທຶກການຈັດສົ່ງຫຼັງຈາກວັນທີສິ້ນສຸດທີ່ວາງແຜນໄວ້ໃນໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The forecast icon gives me the timeline of consumption for the coming months "
"I have to meet."
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນການຄາດຄະເນສະແດງກຳນົດເວລາການນຳໃຊ້ສຳລັບເດືອນຕໍ່ໆໄປທີ່ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕອບສະໜອງໃຫ້ທັນ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The module comes on top of the Construction Builder setup providing "
"additional capabilities."
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນນີ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງເສີມໃສ່ລະບົບ Construction Builder ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. module: construction
#: model:product.template,description_sale:construction.product_product_6_product_template
#: model:sale.order.template.line,name:construction.sale_order_template_line_1014
#: model:sale.order.template.line,name:construction.sale_order_template_line_76
msgid ""
"The prepared mortar is a dry, industrially premixed masonry mortar in "
"strength class M5. The mortar is mainly designed for load-bearing and non-"
"load-bearing masonry."
msgstr ""
"ປູນກໍ່ສຳເລັດຮູບເປັນປູນແຫ້ງທີ່ປະສົມຈາກໂຮງງານອຸດສາຫະກຳ ໃນລະດັບຄວາມແຂງແຮງ M5. ປູນນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາສຳ"
"ລັບວຽກກໍ່ທັງແບບຮັບນ້ຳໜັກ ແລະ ບໍ່ຮັບນ້ຳໜັກ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "The product cost gets updated."
msgstr "ຕົ້ນທຶນສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດແລ້ວ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The products supported by bills of materials are configured to be delivered "
"directly to the customer on processing of the manufacturing orders.<br/>In "
"other words, the need for components are captured on customer working site "
"location, which you can decide how to fulfill."
msgstr ""
"ສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີລາຍການວັດສະດຸ (BOM) ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຈັດສົ່ງເຖິງລູກຄ້າໂດຍກົງເມື່ອດຳເນີນການຕາມໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ.<br/>ເ"
"ວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຊິ້ນສ່ວນປະກອບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກຢູ່ສະຖານທີ່ໜ້າວຽກຂອງລູກຄ້າ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຕັດສິນໃຈວິ"
"ທີການສະໜອງໄດ້."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "The quotation in PDF format"
msgstr "ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໃນຮູບແບບ PDF"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The remarks allow you to capture who is accountable for the remark, an "
"internal user, and who is responsible, could be an external partner.<br/>You "
"can share the remark projects to your subcontractors with different "
"privileges to collaborate in your referential!"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ສັງເກດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານບັນທຶກໄດ້ວ່າໃຜເປັນຜູ້ຮັບຜິດຊອບຂໍ້ສັງເກດ (ຜູ້ໃຊ້ພາຍໃນ) ແລະ ໃຜເປັນຜູ້ປະຕິບັດ (ອາດເປັນຄູ່"
"ຮ່ວມງານພາຍນອກ).<br/>ທ່ານສາມາດແບ່ງປັນໂຄງການຂໍ້ສັງເກດໃຫ້ຜູ້ຮັບເໝົາຊ່ວງດ້ວຍສິດທິທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ເພື່ອເຮັດ"
"ວຽກຮ່ວມກັນໃນລະບົບດຽວກັນ!"

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The start date is affected if recording delivery before the manufacturing "
"order planned beginning."
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ ຖ້າບັນທຶກການຈັດສົ່ງກ່ອນວັນທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ວາງແຜນໄວ້ໃນໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The vendor price list accounts for this new price in product Purchase tab to "
"capture better deals (on cost and quantity)."
msgstr ""
